      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it possible for multilib to be \"32\" but for both \"32\" and \"64\" to be in `bitness`? How is `bitness` different from `depProps.Multilib`?",
      "revId": "f4eb421aa2e3b5c375504006facc30f761e60519",
